{"batch_number":28,"batch_size":90,"cases":[{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-01-sentence-0001","input":"集群中的每一个都有一个名称来标识在同类资源中的唯一性。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names.md","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-0001","split":"documentation_01"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-01-sentence-0017","input":"某些资源类型需要其名称遵循 RFC 1123 所定义的 DNS 标签标准。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names.md","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-0017","split":"documentation_01"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-01-sentence-0019","input":"尽管 RFC 1123 在技术上允许标签以数字开头，当前的 Kubernetes 实现要求 RFC 1035 和 RFC 1123 标签都以字母字符开头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names.md","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-0019","split":"documentation_01"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-01-sentence-0022","input":"换句话说，其名称不能是 `.`、`..`，也不可以包含 `/` 或 `%` 这些字符。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names.md","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-0022","split":"documentation_01"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-02-sentence-0023","input":"对象配置提供了用于创建新对象的模板。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/object-management.md","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-0023","split":"documentation_02"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-02-sentence-0030","input":"使用声明式对象配置时，用户对本地存储的对象配置文件进行操作，但是用户未定义要对该文件执行的操作。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/object-management.md","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-0030","split":"documentation_02"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-02-sentence-0034","input":"可以通过使用 `patch` API 操作仅写入观察到的差异，而不是使用 `replace` API 操作来替换整个对象配置来实现。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/object-management.md","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-0034","split":"documentation_02"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-02-sentence-0039","input":"使用 diff 产生的部分更新会创建复杂的合并和补丁操作。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/object-management.md","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-0039","split":"documentation_02"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0001","input":"本页面讲述 Pod 的生命周期。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0001","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0015","input":"你可以使用 Pod 调度就绪态来延迟 Pod 的调度，直到所有的调度门控都被移除。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0015","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0037","input":"`Succeeded`（成功） | Pod 中的所有容器都已成功结束，并且不会再重启。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0037","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0044","input":"确保不要将 Status（kubectl 用于用户直觉的显示字段）与 Pod 的 `phase` 混淆。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0044","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0045","input":"Pod 阶段（phase）是 Kubernetes 数据模型和 Pod API 的一个明确的部分。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0045","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0054","input":"要检查 Pod 中容器的状态，你可以使用 `kubectl describe pod `。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0054","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0061","input":"如果你使用 `kubectl` 来查询包含 `Running` 状态的容器的 Pod 时，你也会看到关于容器进入 `Running` 状态的信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0061","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0065","input":"Kubernetes 通过在 Pod `spec` 中定义的 `restartPolicy` 管理 Pod 内容器出现的失效。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0065","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0079","input":"容器的存活探针或者启动探针返回 `失败` 结果，如探针部分所述。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0079","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0084","input":"检查资源限制：确保容器被分配了足够的 CPU 和内存。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0084","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0085","input":"有时，增加 Pod 定义中的资源可以解决问题。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0085","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0086","input":"调试应用程序：应用程序代码中可能存在错误或配置不当。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0086","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0087","input":"在本地或开发环境中运行此容器镜像有助于诊断应用程序的特定问题。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0087","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0091","input":"Kubernetes 项目建议遵循云原生原则，包括能够应对未预告或随意重启的弹性设计。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0091","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0093","input":"无论哪种方式，都有助于确保即使在部分故障的情况下，你的整体工作负载依然保持可用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0093","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0099","input":"`OnFailure`：只有在容器错误退出（退出状态非零）时才重新启动容器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0099","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0109","input":"如果你的集群启用了 `ContainerRestartRules` 特性门控，你可以针对单个容器指定 `restartPolicy` 和 `restartPolicyRules` 来覆盖 Pod 重启策略。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0109","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0116","input":"此外，单个容器可以指定 `restartPolicyRules`。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0116","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0118","input":"`restartPolicyRules` 定义了一系列在容器退出时应用的规则。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0118","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0127","input":"如果 Init 容器失败，则 Pod 也会失败。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0127","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0129","input":"重启规则可用于许多其他高级的生命周期管理场景。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0129","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0144","input":"边车容器可以监控主应用的健康状态，如果该应用进入不可恢复的状态，则触发整个 Pod 重启。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0144","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0145","input":"考虑一种工作负载，其中 watcher 边车负责在主应用出错时从已知良好状态重启主应用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0145","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0147","input":"`watcher-sidecar` 执行命令后以退出码 `88` 退出。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0147","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0150","input":"Pod 保留其 UID、沙箱、IP 和卷。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0150","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0177","input":"在其早期开发过程中，这种状况被命名为 `PodHasNetwork`。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0177","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0205","input":"考虑使用 PodDisruptionBudget 来控制可用性。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0205","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0215","input":"如果响应的状态是 \"SERVING\"，则认为诊断成功。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0215","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0217","input":"如果响应的状态码大于等于 200 且小于 400，则诊断被认为是成功的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0217","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0221","input":"如果远程系统（容器）在打开连接后立即将其关闭，这算作是健康的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0221","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0222","input":"和其他机制不同，`exec` 探针的实现涉及每次执行时创建/复制多个进程。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0222","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0232","input":"控制器将从与该 Pod 匹配的所有 Service 的 EndpointSlice 中删除该 Pod 的 IP 地址。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0232","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0235","input":"`startupProbe` : 指示容器中的应用是否已经启动。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0235","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0242","input":"如果要仅在探测成功时才开始向 Pod 发送请求流量，请指定就绪态探针。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0242","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0257","input":"这一设置有助于减少死锁状况的发生。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0257","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0271","input":"如果启用了 `ContainerStopSignals` 特性门控（feature gate），你可以通过容器的生命周期（Lifecycle）配置自定义的终止信号。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0271","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0303","input":"默认情况下，所有的删除操作都会附有 30 秒钟的宽限期限。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0303","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0310","input":"在节点侧，被设置为立即终止的 Pod 仍然会在被强行杀死之前获得一点点的宽限时间。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0310","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0320","input":"同样地，如果 Pod 有一个 `preStop` 钩子超过了终止宽限期，可能会发生紧急终止。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0320","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0325","input":"孤儿 Pod - 绑定到不再存在的节点，计划外终止的 Pod 终止过程中的 Pod，绑定到有 `node.kubernetes.io/out-of-service` 污点的未就绪节点。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0325","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0327","input":"此外，PodGC 在清理孤儿 Pod 时会添加 Pod 干扰状况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0327","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0347","input":"进一步了解 Sidecar 容器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0347","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0026","input":"只要 Service 中的 Pod 集合发生变化，Kubernetes 就会为其更新 EndpointSlice。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0026","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0036","input":"Kubernetes 为该 Service 分配一个 IP 地址（称为“集群 IP”），供虚拟 IP 地址机制使用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0036","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0043","input":"启用该特性后，Service 对象的名称必须符合 RFC 1123 标签名称的规范。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0043","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0048","input":"Service 的默认协议是 TCP；你还可以使用其他受支持的任何协议。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0048","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0049","input":"由于许多 Service 需要公开多个端口，所以 Kubernetes 为同一 Service 定义多个端口。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0049","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0053","input":"你希望让你的 Service 指向另一个中或其它集群中的 Service。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0053","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0069","input":"在没有选择算符的 Service 示例中，流量被路由到 EndpointSlice 清单中定义的两个端点之一：通过 TCP 协议连接到 10.1.2.3 或 10.4.5.6 的端口 9376。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0069","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0070","input":"Kubernetes API 服务器不允许将流量代理到未被映射至 Pod 上的端点。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0070","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0071","input":"由于此约束，当 Service 没有选择算符时，诸如 `kubectl port-forward service/ forwardedPort:servicePort` 之类的操作将会失败。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0071","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0072","input":"这可以防止 Kubernetes API 服务器被用作调用者可能无权访问的端点的代理。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0072","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0074","input":"更多的相关信息，请参阅 ExternalName 一节。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0074","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0075","input":"EndpointSlice 对象表示某个 Service 的后端网络端点的子集（切片）。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0075","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0076","input":"你的 Kubernetes 集群会跟踪每个 EndpointSlice 所表示的端点数量。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0076","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0085","input":"Kubernetes 限制单个 Endpoints 对象中可以容纳的端点数量。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0085","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0086","input":"当一个 Service 拥有 1000 个以上支撑端点时，Kubernetes 会截断 Endpoints 对象中的数据。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0086","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0091","input":"这一 API 限制也意味着你不能手动将 Endpoints 更新为拥有超过 1000 个端点。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0091","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0096","input":"IANA 标准服务名称。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0096","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0112","input":"Kubernetes 不直接提供负载均衡组件；你必须提供一个，或者将你的 Kubernetes 集群与某个云平台集成。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0112","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0119","input":"此默认 Service 类型从你的集群中为此预留的 IP 地址池中分配一个 IP 地址。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0119","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0126","input":"如果你尝试创建一个带有非法 `clusterIP` 地址值的 Service，API 服务器会返回 HTTP 状态码 422，表示值不合法。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0126","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0135","input":"如果需要特定的端口号，你可以在 `nodePort` 字段中指定一个值。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0135","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0146","input":"如果每个节点都连接到多个网络（例如：一个网络用于应用流量，另一网络用于节点和控制平面之间的流量），你可能想要这样做。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0146","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0158","input":"要实现 `type: LoadBalancer` 的服务，Kubernetes 通常首先进行与请求 `type: NodePort` 服务类似的更改。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0158","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0160","input":"你可以将负载均衡 Service 配置为忽略分配节点端口，前提是云平台实现支持这点。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0160","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0162","input":"这时，平台将使用用户指定的 `loadBalancerIP` 来创建负载均衡器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0162","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0167","input":"它也不支持双协议栈联网。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0167","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0172","input":"负载均衡器运行状态检查对于现代应用程序至关重要，它们用于确定负载均衡器应将流量分派到哪个服务器（虚拟机或 IP 地址）。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0172","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0174","input":"负载均衡器运行状态检查广泛用于支持 Service 的 `externalTrafficPolicy` 字段。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0174","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0179","input":"这仅适用于负载均衡器的实现能够直接将流量路由到 Pod 而不是使用节点端口的情况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0179","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0186","input":"所有默认的负载均衡器实现（例如，由云平台所提供的）都会忽略设置了此字段的 Service。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0186","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0187","input":"`.spec.loadBalancerClass` 只能设置到类型为 `LoadBalancer` 的 Service 之上，而且一旦设置之后不可变更。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0187","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0188","input":"`.spec.loadBalancerClass` 的值必须是一个标签风格的标识符，可以有选择地带有类似 \"`internal-vip`\" 或 \"`example.com/internal-vip`\" 这类前缀。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0188","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0189","input":"没有前缀的名字是保留给最终用户的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0189","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0211","input":"有时你并不需要负载均衡，也不需要单独的 Service IP。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0211","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0232","input":"你可以阅读 makeLinkVariables 来了解这是如何在 Kubernetes 中实现的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0232","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0236","input":"例如，如果你在 Kubernetes 命名空间 `my-ns` 中有一个名为 `my-service` 的 Service，则控制平面和 DNS 服务共同为 `my-service.my-ns` 生成 DNS 记录。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0236","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0239","input":"这些名称将解析为分配给 Service 的集群 IP。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0239","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0240","input":"Kubernetes 还支持命名端口的 DNS SRV（Service）记录。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concep